# One unqualified Jetpack unit. This list is the only assembly order; do not glob sources into the unit.
# Order follows the dependency graph: shared Compiler front end (referenced, never copied), package and
# environment models, Nix evaluation, store, trust, providers, environments/services/images/recipes, CLI.
# JetOS is out of scope for this port; no JetOS source or hook belongs in this unit.
# Each area appends only under its own section header. Test sources live in tests.list.

# == Foundation ==
Jetpack/Foundation/Source/Syntax.jet
Jetpack/Foundation/Source/BuildEffect.jet

# == Compiler front end (referenced from Compiler/, never copied) ==
Compiler/JetFoundation/Source/Hash/SHA256.jet

# == PackageModel ==
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Text/ByteText.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Platform/Platform.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Refs/RefSpec.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Refs/RefMigration.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Merge/Merge.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Workspace/OverlayScan.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Workspace/OverlayPolicy.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Workspace/OverlayParse.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Recipe/BuildRecipe.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Recipe/StagedPlan.jet

# == EnvModel ==

